{ "@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "VideoObject", "name": "JMU community responds to Nepal disaster", "description": "The impact of the floods in Nepal is also felt among the JMU community. Breeze TV’s Sydney Sultanik meet with students and faculty to see what they are doing in response.", "thumbnailUrl": "https://bloximages.newyork1.vip.townnews.com/breezejmu.org/content/tncms/assets/v3/editorial/a/58/a58efdea-ff64-4539-bbc9-980195567123/6ab07a4767591.preview.jpg", "uploadDate": "2026-09-20T20:30:00-04:00", "contentUrl": "https://youtu.be/cnJWebSlxB0" }

The impact of the floods in Nepal is also felt among the JMU community. Breeze TV’s Sydney Sultanik meet with students and faculty to see what they are doing in response.
